@Notes for developers: Use 'Getlistingstatus' to check if there is a list by ID
@Note by script writers: Use 'Setlistingstatus' to change the registration status in this script
Use: This script raises information on registration when you press on it. It also has a feature that updates a registration characteristic by editing this property in GUI, or by changing the value of variable in text block.
Click the right mouse button on each list record. Select "Detail of Registration" in the menu that appears. The menu will expand and include a full list of listing. You can then expand these items as much as you want to see detailed information. When you start to press something to get more information, you'll want a "split window". Do this on the top top, just over the program icon. That way you can view all the open things on a single screen without having to return to different windows, which is tedious.
